        {
          "text": "disableInteract\n            ? `Displaying PDF: ${normalized}`\n            : `PDF opened. viewUUID: ${uuid}\n\nâ†’ To annotate, sign, stamp, fill forms, navigate, extract, or save to a file: call \\`interact\\` with this viewUUID.\nâ†’ DO NOT call display_pdf again â€” that spawns a separate viewer with a different viewUUID; your interact calls would target the new empty one, not the one the user is looking at.\n\nURL: ${normalized}`",
